        "content": "# WARN Layoff Alerts\n\nnew WARN Act layoff notices from 7 states.\n\n**Setup (2 min)**\n1. In n8n: Credentials > New > Header Auth. Name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` (token from Apify Console > Settings > Integrations). Select it on the Run actor node (the credential id in this file is a placeholder: REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL).\n2. Edit the JSON body of Run actor to your own filters.\n3. Replace the Your destination node with Google Sheets, Slack, a CRM, etc.\n4. Activate the Schedule trigger (default: daily 07:00).\n\nRuns synchronously (up to about 5 minutes). For larger jobs use the async run and dataset endpoints. Check the actor's Store page for pricing before scheduling.\n\n_Disclosure: I maintain the Apify actor this workflow calls (Apify account transparent_meteorite). The workflow itself is free to use; the actor is a paid pay-per-event Apify actor, with free-plan credit covering a trial._",
